notes.content:
Hello, friends! We are happy to say that we have fixed some issues that have been bugging players for a while now, these include:

-Missing achievements of total amount of found cats;
-Invisible cats on the main level;
-Main level building segment not colored even with completed game;
-Being unable to click on remaining people on the main level;
-Game occupying 2 GB of space;
-Not receiving No Hint on Normal mode achievement when completing main level without hint.

You may now return to enjoying the game as it was intended, happy finding!!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42715547/2eed5fcd3e7466348cc1f6ed3433e4c6f404846f.png[/img]

Hello friends, we have been working on all games from Hidden Cats Series to fix reported issues.
Here are the last updates for London.


FIXED - Cat counter with wrong numbers in Advanced Mode;
FIXED - Hint not working in Advanced Mode;
FIXED - Unable to click on people in Advanced Mode;
FIXED - Achievements problems.
FIXED - Camera keyboard (WASD) controls;
FIXED - Meow SFX options not working properly;
FIXED - Bug that causes a level to be inaccessible sometimes;
FIXED - Bonus levels sometimes show cats' position when starting the level.


NOTE:
Due to the technical nature of the game, sometimes updates can be quite big compared to the game size already installed, even when the update itself is a small thing. But, make note that this won't increase too much of your install files as it is already.
